singleton propagation and eight-bit pixel-format loss scoring from FFmpeg
libavfilter/formats.c, libavfilter/avfiltergraph.c and libavutil/pixdesc.c at
commit 946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8.

