src/scale-expression.ts adapts single-input expression evaluation, command state
and dimension adjustment from FFmpeg libavfilter/vf_scale.c and scale_eval.c at
946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8, Copyright (c) 2007 Bobby Bingham,
